      "wish": "To my favourite little explorer: four is a wonderful age for big questions. Never stop asking them.",
      "memory": "Last spring you insisted on carrying the watering can all by yourself, the whole way round the garden. It was nearly as big as you, and you did not spill a single drop on the tulips. You told me the flowers were thirsty, and that a princess has to look after her kingdom.",
